<title>USA: Syncor Q1 shr rises to $0.32 after gain.</title>
<headline>Syncor Q1 shr rises to $0.32 after gain.</headline>
<text>
<p>WOODLAND HILLS, Calif.--(BW HealthWire)--April 30,</p>
<p>		  SYNCOR INTERNATIONAL CORP. AND SUBSIDIARIES</p>
<p>			 Consolidated Statements of Income</p>
<p>		     (In Thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>						   3 Mos Ended March 31,</p>
<p>						   1997		 1996</p>
<p>Net sales				    $93,084	    $92,021</p>
